The Explorers of NannyMUD      NannyMUD Times                         Page 4

  The NannyMUD Explorers, a report by Noble.

  Joining Explorer's club located in Andra and Erendis' area is a rewarding
  experience that I highly recommend to all players, especially new players.
  The area is located 23 west of the green, from there travel in a northerly
  direction and through a small, but very confusing forest before hitting the
  main forest. 
  
  Once there you will find a treehouse hidden amongst the towering trees. 
  There is a shelf of scrolls with comments on areas that players have made 
  and there are writing materials for comments on different areas you have 
  visited. You will receive Explorers globe which will keep track of the 
  areas you have visited and totally explored. You will be informed when you 
  have explored an area by the globe lighting up.

  The levels of expertise in exploring remain somewhat of a mystery. You will 
  see your levels of expertise change as you explore more. Should you happen 
  to get lost it will help someone give you guidance as to how to find your 
  way back to the main roads of Nanny.

  I am an explorer at heart and like to know whos area I am visiting.  Knowing
  whose area you are in allows you to look the wizard's booklet up in the
  Tourist bureau to learn more about what is there.

  There is also the Explorers line on which you can compare notes with other 
  players. I hope you will visit Andra and Erendis' area and join the club 
  to become an explorer too.

